  "prefLabel": "En 3002.18 Sanctionable event",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 3002.18 “Sanctionable event” means a CNGS or aggregator has:\n\n(1) Violated any provision of the rules included in this chapter;\n\n(2) Violated the requirements of RSA 12-P:15 or any provision of RSA Title XXXIV applicable to CNGS or aggregators; or\n\n(3) Engaged in any unfair or deceptive acts or practices in the marketing, sale, or solicitation of natural gas or related services.\n\nSource. #14593, eff 5-21-26, EXPIRES: 5-21-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en3000.html"
